{"id": "2076", "title": "寄生体", "author": "黑天魔神", "category": "科幻小说", "count": 174, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/2/2076/2076s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/2/2076.htm", "intro": "从满是尸体死亡之城中逃亡而出的雷震，意外被变异的生化细胞感染。成为异化线粒体的寄生者。在充满危机的逃亡之路上，个人的力量，必须对抗成千上万的变异居民。侥幸的生还后，却被当作知情者必须处死。面对危难，强大的寄生者只能凭借进化的本能，与科技的力量相抗衡。\r\n　　然而，地球的整体局势，却在这个时候发生了翻天覆地的变化。拥有不同控制力量的权力者，纷纷划分出属于自己的势力范围。。。。。。", "base": "files/article/html/2/2076", "chapters": [{"title": "第一节 死地", "file": "3703879.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二节 避难", "file": "3703880.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三节 男生", "file": "3703881.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四节 获救", "file": "3703882.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五节 撤退", "file": "3703883.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六节 生路", "file": "3703884.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七节 感染", "file": "3703885.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八节 疼痛", "file": "3703886.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九节 食肉", "file": "3703887.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十节 权力", "file": "3703888.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一节 群杀", "file": "3703889.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二节 反复（1）", "file": "3703890.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三节 反复（2）", "file": "3703891.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四节 溶蚀", "file": "3703892.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五节 大官", "file": "3703893.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六节 醉汉（1）", "file": "3703894.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七节 醉汉（2）", "file": "3703895.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八节（上）细胞", "file": "3703896.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八节（下）细胞", "file": "3703897.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九节 尸攻(上)", "file": "3703898.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九节 尸攻(下)", "file": "3703899.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十节 尸兽（上）", "file": "3703900.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十节 尸兽（下）", "file": "3703901.html", "available": false}, 